- getParticipantsList(report, personalDetails, false) -> shouldExcludeHiddenParticipants = true (not group, not IOU). With bug, returns all entries. Then filter details => same as count. Still non-empty.

Hmm, so with the bug, both count and list would be non-empty and consistent. That contradicts "list empty".

Therefore the planted bug is probably NOT the return statement (or the return statement is upstream code that I misremember). Let me reconsider.

